"Working source link" means a functioning URL or other public source location
that reasonably identifies the canonical source for YMB and allows the source
to be found without unusual effort.

3. Limited Permission To Use

You may Use YMB for its normal intended purpose without asking for permission.
Allowed Use includes creating, building, validating, previewing, syncing, and
recovering mods, including mods used in commercial projects.

This license is source-available, not open source. No right is granted to
Distribute YMB or to create or share derivative versions of YMB except as
